    <p>
      Degrees and professional bodies matter where the law or a licence gate the work. Statutory audit in India is CA work. Skipping the
      credential there is not an option, so you plan the whole route. Where the credential is only a signal, the problem is
      credential-only thinking. A CFA Level I pass with nothing built beside it is a receipt, not a skill portfolio.
    </p>
