  <h2 id="ca">CA: stages, clocks and the real fee list</h2>

  <p>
    CA is the clearest case of a multi-stage race. You clear a hard entry exam, then a harder middle stage, then two years of training
    where you compete for a good firm, then a Final with a lower pass rate than most people expect. Each stage is a separate filter.
  </p>

