    different Foundation fees for 2026, so check the current fee on the ICAI portal.
  </p>

  <div class="highlight-box highlight-box--amber">
    <p>
      <strong>Multi-stage competition, flagged.</strong> CA has a hard entry filter at Foundation, another at Intermediate, a scramble for
      good training seats, and a Final with its own filter. Clearing one stage does not make the next easier. Keep a second route or a
      running skill, such as Tally, GST knowledge and Excel, so a failed attempt does not leave you with nothing.
    </p>
