        <li>Open to Indian nationals who passed or are appearing in Class 12. Graduates may be exempt from CSEET.</li>
        <li>Work is company law, governance, filings and board support. It is law-heavy, not number-heavy.</li>
        <li>June 2026 results: Executive 17.41% and 22.19% by group, Professional 32.69% and 29.49%.</li>
        <li>Training is part of the route. Confirm its length with ICSI.</li>
