        <li>ICAI Foundation study material, hosted on its own knowledge portal.</li>
        <li>A CFA Level I at USD 1,140 early, if you register on time.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="compare-card compare-card--gold">
      <div class="compare-card__label">Where the money grows</div>
      <ul>
        <li>Repeat attempts. Each stage can be sat again, with a new form fee each time.</li>
        <li>Coaching and test series, which are optional but heavily marketed.</li>
        <li>Dollar and pound fees. CFA is USD 3,520 to USD 4,570 for three levels. US CPA India fees add USD 460 per section.</li>
        <li>Years of income given up while you study or train on a small stipend.</li>
